# {{lb|en|music genre}} A type of [[Christian]] [[music]] [[genre]] that is a cornerstone of the Christian [[media]] that originated amongst [[African-Americans]] based on the [[folk music]] [[melodies]] with the addition of elements of [[spiritual]]s and [[jazz]].

